<title>USA: P.T. Pasifik Satelit Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>P.T. Pasifik Satelit Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>P.T. Pasifik Satelit Nusantara of Indonesia said net income for the second quarter ended June 30, 1996 increased to US$577,389 on revenues of US$3.4 million from US$121,267 on revenues of US$831,015.</p>
<p>The company said total revenues for the six months rose 143 percent to US$3.8 million from US$1.6 million, while the net loss for the period narrowed to US$98,638 from US$3.1 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
